—❗️🇮🇷/🇴🇲 NEW: At the request of Iran, the Sultanate of Oman has stopped cooperating with the U.S. and facilitating escorted tanker movements through the southern part of the Strait of Hormuz

In the past 24 hours, no vessels have passed via the Omani route; today, an Indian vessel faced warning shots from the IRGC Navy, forcing it to turn around.

@Middle_East_Spectator
